WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:01.376
♪♪

00:00:01.376 --> 00:00:02.586
Emily:
Here's an idea.

00:00:02.586 --> 00:00:07.549
Let's just run all the way to
the edge of the earth and...
fall off.

00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:09.676
♪♪

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:10.636
Sounds nice.

00:00:10.636 --> 00:00:12.179
♪♪

00:00:12.179 --> 00:00:15.933
♪When the night is long♪

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:17.142
Emily:
Promise me something, Sue.

00:00:17.142 --> 00:00:19.394
♪♪

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:21.146
That you'll always love me more
then him.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.732
I wouldn't worry too much about
that one.

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:28.153
♪Cause all I want is you♪

00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:29.571
♪All I want is you♪

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:30.489
What are they so afraid of?

00:00:30.489 --> 00:00:32.282
Maybe they're scared if they
teach us how the world works 

00:00:32.282 --> 00:00:33.575
we'll figure out how to take
over.

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:34.368
Hmm.

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:35.077
Hmm.

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:38.163
You really are my favorite
person in the world.

00:00:38.163 --> 00:00:40.207
♪♪

00:00:40.207 --> 00:00:42.668
You know I'm gonna miss sleeping
in your bed, right?

00:00:42.668 --> 00:00:45.045
♪I'll shelter there with you♪

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:46.672
You're the only one I have.

00:00:47.506 --> 00:00:50.592
Without you... I might as
well not exist.

00:00:51.301 --> 00:00:52.511
Sue:
I have to tell you...

00:00:53.512 --> 00:00:57.808
I never though I'd be jealous
of... a man stealing your heart.

00:00:57.808 --> 00:00:58.850
♪♪

00:00:58.850 --> 00:00:59.851
You jealous?

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:04.356
Sue:
Marriage and motherhood, it's
too much.

00:01:04.356 --> 00:01:05.565
It's all too much I...

00:01:06.525 --> 00:01:09.987
I... I hate the fact that...

00:01:10.529 --> 00:01:11.363
That what?

00:01:11.363 --> 00:01:13.657
...you are not doing it with me.

00:01:13.657 --> 00:01:15.367
♪♪

00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:19.162
Only you would show up at a
party... looking like a raccoon.

00:01:19.162 --> 00:01:20.414
I'm not here for the party. 

00:01:20.414 --> 00:01:21.581
I'm here to see you.

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:23.583
Emily: I need to know.
-Sue: Emily!

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:25.711
What did you think of my poems,
tell me?

00:01:25.711 --> 00:01:26.920
I loved them.

00:01:27.713 --> 00:01:29.673
The biggest thing that I don't
want to feel..

00:01:29.673 --> 00:01:30.382
Is what?

00:01:31.717 --> 00:01:32.175
Emily:
Hmm.

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:33.927
Is what!

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:35.887
What is it, Sue?

00:01:35.887 --> 00:01:36.638
Just say it!

00:01:36.638 --> 00:01:38.056
Is that I'm in love with you.

00:01:38.307 --> 00:01:39.182
I don't believe you.

00:01:39.683 --> 00:01:40.475
It's true.

00:01:41.518 --> 00:01:42.769
What is it that you crave?

00:01:44.062 --> 00:01:44.813
You crave meaning.

00:01:46.189 --> 00:01:47.357
You crave beauty.

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:50.986
You crave love.

00:01:52.154 --> 00:01:53.155
I love Sue!

00:01:53.155 --> 00:01:56.033
And I, I want her and I can't
get enough of her.

00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:59.578
And if I was on my deathbed
right now all I'd want is, Sue!

00:01:59.578 --> 00:02:02.831
♪All I want is you♪

00:02:02.831 --> 00:02:06.084
♪When you're drowning in the
blue♪

00:02:06.084 --> 00:02:09.880
♪I'll shelter there with you♪

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:13.633
♪Do what only I can do♪

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:14.718
♪♪

00:02:14.718 --> 00:02:15.927
Emily:
I can't live with you.

00:02:16.762 --> 00:02:19.514
I can't breath without you and I
can't write without you.

00:02:19.514 --> 00:02:21.683
♪♪

00:02:21.683 --> 00:02:24.770
♪All I want it you♪

